{"id":"a_nimo","lemma":"ánimo","pos":"noun","rank":2151,"glosses":["soul, spirit, mood","vigour"],"ipa":"/ˈanimo/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"ánimos"},"order":2174,"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-%C3%A1nimo.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ánimo, que ya casi estamos allí.","en":"Come on, we're almost there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/540742","words":[null,{"g":"that"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"almost"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"Me levanté el ánimo escuchando música.","en":"I cheered myself up by listening to music.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/788320","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to lift","l":"levantar"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"to listen to","l":"escuchar"},{"g":"music"}]},{"text":"Le dio ánimos porque estaba decaído.","en":"She cheered him up because he was depressed.","words":[{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},null,{"g":"because"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to decay","l":"decaer"}]}]}